<title>USA: Connie Lee has capacity for N.Y. State agencies.</title>
<headline>Connie Lee has capacity for N.Y. State agencies.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Connie Lee Insurance Co said Wednesday it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for the following issues:</p>
<p>--New York State Med Care/Dormitory Authority, mental health facilities, 20-year minimum maturity.</p>
<p>--New York State Dormitory Authority, State University System, 10-year minimum maturity.</p>
<p>Capacity is on a first-come, first-served basis in $1 milion block minimum size.</p>
<p>For more information, call Larry Weiss at 202-728-3436 or 800-877-5333.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
